## rules.yaml
briefing =
    Establish your base, then build and defend the Temple of Nod.
    All GDI forces are to be destroyed. Kane has ordered you to defend
    the Temple at all costs, even your own life. Do not allow GDI forces
    to overrun you.

## lua
build-temple = Construct the Temple of Nod.
commando-arrived = Kane has sent a commando and a transport helicopter near the church.
reinforcements-chinook = An empty GDI transport has landed to the west. Capture it with an Engineer.
church-destroyed = The church has been destroyed. A money crate is available.
mcv-arrived = A second MCV has arrived in the west. Deploy it on the mainland.
mcv-lost = The reinforcement MCV was lost. A replacement is on its way.
gdi-hq-destroyed = The GDI Communications Center has been destroyed. Nod reinforcements are on the way.
destroy-gdi-communications-center = Destroy or capture the GDI Communications Center in the northern base to stop their airstrikes.
destroy-gdi-advanced-communications-center = Destroy or capture the GDI Advanced Communications Center in the south-western base to stop their Ion Cannon and western reinforcements.
airstrikes-stopped = The GDI Communications Center in the northern base has been destroyed or captured. Their airstrikes have stopped.
ion-cannon-online = Warning: the GDI Ion Cannon is now online.
ion-cannon-offline = The GDI Advanced Communications Center has been destroyed or captured. Their Ion Cannon is offline and western reinforcements have stopped.
